  "body": "<img src=\"https://github.com/9001/copyparty/raw/hovudstraum/docs/logo.svg\" width=\"250\" align=\"right\"/>\r\n\r\n* read-only demo server at https://a.ocv.me/pub/demo/\r\n* [docker image](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/tree/hovudstraum/scripts/docker) ╱ [similar software](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/blob/hovudstraum/docs/versus.md) ╱ [client testbed](https://cd.ocv.me/b/)\r\n\r\nthere is a [discord server](https://discord.gg/25J8CdTT6G) with an `@everyone` in case of future important updates, such as [vulnerabilities](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/security) (most recently 2026-10-06)\r\n\r\n## ⚠️ ATTN: this release mitigates a Windows/MacOS-specific issue with shadowing\r\n\r\n[GHSA-3c88-p299-7hvr](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/security/advisories/GHSA-3c88-p299-7hvr): due to windows/macos having case-insensitive (casefolding) filesystems, [shadowing](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/#shadowing) is not bulletproof, even with this fix\r\n\r\n## recent important news\r\n\r\n* [v1.20.25 (2026-10-05)](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/releases/tag/v1.20.25) improved shadowing on Windows/MacOS\r\n* [v1.20.19 (2026-07-27)](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/releases/tag/v1.20.19) fixed an FTP-server vuln (upload outside defined volumes)\r\n* [v1.20.17 (2026-07-06)](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/releases/tag/v1.20.17) introduced csp nonces, possibly breaking some javascript-based plugins\r\n\r\n## 🧪 new features\r\n\r\n* #1498 [--acao-re](https://copyparty.eu/cli/#g-acao-re) for allowing cross-domain access with more complex rules ab2299e3\r\n* #1652 [redup](https://copyparty.eu/cli/#redup-help-page): detect and skip hardlinks / reflinks which are already optimally deduplicated 08093578\r\n* [--sftp-fastldr](https://copyparty.eu/cli/#g-sftp-fastldr) to improve startup time on extremely old hardware 186cbf93\r\n* [--sftp-chattr](https://copyparty.eu/cli/#g-sftp-chattr) to restrict chattr to certain properties e59fc05e\r\n\r\n## 🩹 bugfixes\r\n\r\n* GHSA-3c88-p299-7hvr e8de4211\r\n  * for further context, torvalds has some [technically accurate and colourful opinions](https://lore.kernel.org/lkml/CAHk-=wjajMJyoTv2KZdpVRoPn0LFZ94Loci37WLVXmMxDbLOjg@mail.gmail.com/) (nsfw) on how casefolding filesystems are an ongoing mistake\r\n  * on a more serious note, [the readme was updated](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/#shadowing)\r\n* fix uploads struggling to resume from a network glitch if the server filesystem is FAT32 or exFAT 23e00c0a 731dbbff\r\n* #1647 shares: fix cleanup of single-file shares when manually deleted before expiration (thx @willie6666!) f445bfa8\r\n* #1660 ban-pw now more aggressive on failed basic-auth (thx @PAStheLoD!) 5e0a88e3\r\n* #1656 webdav: return 404 instead of 400 when file didn't exist 74b17374\r\n* fix navigating to an index.html webroot (thx @tilse!) 334dccc5\r\n* fix IP-address detection on Windows XP 107dec9e\r\n\r\n## 🔧 other changes\r\n\r\n* #1658 constant-time verification of filekeys/dirkeys (thx @rozbb!) a31870cb\r\n* prevent enabling the smb server unless `--hack-me-bro` is also enabled because the smb-server was intentionally made super-insecure so it would work with ancient outdated equipment in emergencies and should never be used otherwise 1341b342\r\n* now possible to upload [09. t+pazolite - I still think about y%#'()_*{\\\\\"'&36)%(\"'$&''&(15y!!!_??*`~.flac](https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=btPU_rluFSE) (dont click that link on acid) 28f9f6f0 64f574fe\r\n\r\n## 🌠 fun facts\r\n\r\n* [thx t+paz](https://a.ocv.me/pub/g/2026/10/Screenshot_20261002-221751_1.png?cache)\r\n\r\n----\r\n\r\n# 💾 what to download?\r\n| download link | is it good? | description |\r\n| -- | -- | -- |\r\n| **[copyparty-sfx.py](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/releases/latest/download/copyparty-sfx.py)** | ✅ the best 👍 | runs anywhere! only needs python |\r\n| [copyparty-en.py](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/releases/latest/download/copyparty-en.py) | ✅ also good | same but english-only, no i18n |\r\n| [a docker image](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/blob/hovudstraum/scripts/docker/README.md) | it's ok | good if you prefer docker 🐋 |\r\n| [copyparty.exe](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/releases/latest/download/copyparty.exe) |  ⚠️ [acceptable](https://github.com/9001/copyparty#copypartyexe) | for [win8](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/241032/221445946-1e328e56-8c5b-44a9-8b9f-dee84d942535.png) or later; built-in thumbnailer |\r\n| [u2c.exe](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/releases/download/v1.20.25/u2c.exe) | ⚠️ acceptable | [CLI uploader](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/blob/hovudstraum/bin/u2c.py) as a win7+ exe ([video](https://a.ocv.me/pub/demo/pics-vids/u2cli.webm)) |\r\n| [copyparty.pyz](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/releases/latest/download/copyparty.pyz) | ⚠️ acceptable | similar to the regular sfx, [mostly worse](https://github.com/9001/copyparty#zipapp) |\r\n| [copyparty-en.pyz](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/releases/latest/download/copyparty-en.pyz) | ⚠️ acceptable | english-only, no smb-server |\r\n| [copyparty32.exe](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/releases/latest/download/copyparty32.exe) | ⛔️ [dangerous](https://github.com/9001/copyparty#copypartyexe) | for [win7](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/241032/221445944-ae85d1f4-d351-4837-b130-82cab57d6cca.png) -- never expose to the internet! |\r\n| [cpp-winpe64.exe](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/releases/download/v1.16.5/copyparty-winpe64.exe) | ⛔️ dangerous | runs on [64bit WinPE](https://user-images.githubusercontent.com/241032/205454984-e6b550df-3c49-486d-9267-1614078dd0dd.png), otherwise useless |\r\n| [bootable usb](https://a.ocv.me/pub/stuff/edcd001/enterprise-edition/) | ┐(ﾟ∀ﾟ)┌ | a surprisingly useful joke (x86_64) |\r\n\r\n* except for [u2c.exe](https://github.com/9001/copyparty/releases/download/v1.20.25/u2c.exe), all of the options above are mostly equivalent\r\n* the zip and tar.gz files below are just source code\r\n* python packages are available at [PyPI](https://pypi.org/project/copyparty/#files)",
